      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "description": "Streams owned by this fleet's nodes: pull (operator holds a WebSocket) and push (node dials the target). reconnecting = consumer away, frames held in the outage buffer (recording.live.outage_buffer_ms).",
